// Output configuration.
//
// Niri already enables connected monitors using their preferred modes and
// automatically positions them, so no output block is required for the current
// laptop + LG setup.
//
// Only add an output block when you want to override Niri's automatic behavior.
// Run `niri msg outputs` to see connector names and exact available modes.
//
// Example:
//
// /- output "HDMI-A-1" {
//     mode "2560x1080@74.991"
//     scale 1
//     position x=1366 y=0
// }
//
// "/-" comments out the output node, so the example above has no effect.
